{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>When one hunts game.</b> Since hunting grounds are mostly desolate and likely to harbor shedim there — as it says: וְשָׁכְנוּ שָׁם בְּנוֹת יַעֲנָה וּשְׂעִירִים יְרַקְּדוּ שָׁם (Isaiah 13:21) — He forbade leaving uncovered blood there and commanded to cover it with earth, in order to remove the possibility of shedim being present there. And He said."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:40.516980834Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}